  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Lamb?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> This is about the baby animal. For the adult, see <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-2350\" title=\"Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sheep</a>.</i></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/56/Lamb.png/revision/latest?cb=20260510122300\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lamb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"196\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lamb</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 25 • 30</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 800 • 2,300</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Lamb Chop</span><span title=\"Lamb chop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-chop-36740\" title=\"Lamb Chop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Chop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/72/Lamb_Chop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20260512222547\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 30 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lamb</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> that produce <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-chop-36740\" title=\"Lamb Chop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lamb Chop</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 25. They were added since May 2026 Update.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ALamb.png\" title=\"Lamb.png (398 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/56/Lamb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/182?cb=20260510122300\" title=\"Lamb.png (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb.png (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALamb_Bleating.png\" title=\"Lamb Bleating.png (371 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/74/Lamb_Bleating.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/152?cb=20260518162403\" title=\"Lamb Bleating.png (371 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb Bleating\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb Bleating.png (371 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb Bleating\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Bleating</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALamb_Full.png\" title=\"Lamb Full.png (709 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bb/Lamb_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20260510122335\" title=\"Lamb Full.png (709 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb Full.png (709 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AReady_Lamb_Cube.png\" title=\"Ready Lamb Cube.png (462 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Ready_Lamb_Cube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/124?cb=20260517013512\" title=\"Ready Lamb Cube.png (462 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Ready Lamb Cube\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Ready Lamb Cube.png (462 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Ready Lamb Cube\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Ready Lamb Cube</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALamb_Hungry.png\" title=\"Lamb Hungry.png (364 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d2/Lamb_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/183?cb=20260518163958\" title=\"Lamb Hungry.png (364 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb Hungry.png (364 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALamb_Sleeping.png\" title=\"Lamb Sleeping.png (321 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/78/Lamb_Sleeping.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20260518162627\" title=\"Lamb Sleeping.png (321 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb Sleeping\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb Sleeping.png (321 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb Sleeping\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Sleeping</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALamb_Summer.png\" title=\"Lamb Summer.png (566 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b0/Lamb_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/168?cb=20260606231424\" title=\"Lamb Summer.png (566 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lamb Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb Summer.png (566 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lamb Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Summer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image-no-lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" title=\"Lamb Winter.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Lamb Winter.png</span></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Winter</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image-no-lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" title=\"Lamb Halloween.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Lamb Halloween.png</span></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Lamb Halloween</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7d/Lamb_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20260511221917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A lamb pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A lamb pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"87\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A lamb pasture</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Lambs must be placed in <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb pastures</a> to be purchased. Pastures cost 500 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. They are unlocked at levels 25 and 30. Each pasture can house five lambs.\n</p><p>At level 25 lamb cost 800 coins each; at level 30 2,300 coins.\n</p><p>\nLambs and lamb pastures can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.<span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/14/Lamb_Wooden_Bath_Barrel.png/revision/latest?cb=20260512233405\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Wooden Bath Barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wooden Bath Barrel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"143\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Wooden Bath Barrel</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Lamb chop can be sheared from sheep every 30 minutes. Players can skip the wait by paying 3 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> per lamb. Players must then give <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-feed-36738\" title=\"Lamb Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb feed</a> to get another harvest.\n</p><p>Lamb feed is made of:\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/black-bean-36496\" title=\"Black Bean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Bean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>It takes 10 minutes to make 3 units of <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-feed-36738\" title=\"Lamb Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb feed</a>. You can easily collect all your lamb chop and replenish your feed stock by the time the sheep are ready to be sheared again.</li>\n<li>Lamb chop can pretty regularly be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Easter egg</b></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" r